### 4.2 Unified Cost Allocation Model

Every financial transaction MUST carry all applicable dimensions:

| Dimension | Column | Required For | Current State |
|-----------|--------|-------------|---------------|
| `company_id` | All tables | Always | ✅ Enforced |
